{"4606920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Game About Creating The Universe", "steam_appid": 4606920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game About Creating The Universe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incremental game where you get to build the universe from scratch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/5b5cec87e7dc781072b81d065b73c8d8.poster.avif?t=1787928371\" width=616 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/5b5cec87e7dc781072b81d065b73c8d8.webm?t=1787928371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/5b5cec87e7dc781072b81d065b73c8d8.mp4?t=1787928371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a part of an advanced space civilization that builds universes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a society that has mastered its home dimension and now looks to architect new universes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your fleet while you construct universes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/da630df32157e333dc59705fcec5ad05.poster.avif?t=1787928371\" width=616 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/da630df32157e333dc59705fcec5ad05.webm?t=1787928371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/da630df32157e333dc59705fcec5ad05.mp4?t=1787928371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start off by mining and collecting base resources until eventually you build up planets, and entire solar systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You add more and more ships to your fleet while using a skill tree to upgrade various things about your civilization. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Pickups</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the normal skill tree upgrades, every galaxy unlocks special live-pickups that help you during an active run. Things like white-holes that produce more asteroids, to a time-space freezer which freezes all asteroids, to special comets that collect all asteroids at once. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Hazards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each galaxy unfortunately also introduces new hazards like time bombs that destroy all asteroids if not defused in time and rippers that invert the universe so it's all negative for that run. Make sure to avoid or disarm each hazard type.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple difficulty levels</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game About Creating The Universe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incremental game where you get to build the universe from scratch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/5b5cec87e7dc781072b81d065b73c8d8.poster.avif?t=1787928371\" width=616 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/5b5cec87e7dc781072b81d065b73c8d8.webm?t=1787928371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/5b5cec87e7dc781072b81d065b73c8d8.mp4?t=1787928371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a part of an advanced space civilization that builds universes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a society that has mastered its home dimension and now looks to architect new universes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your fleet while you construct universes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/da630df32157e333dc59705fcec5ad05.poster.avif?t=1787928371\" width=616 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/da630df32157e333dc59705fcec5ad05.webm?t=1787928371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/extras/da630df32157e333dc59705fcec5ad05.mp4?t=1787928371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start off by mining and collecting base resources until eventually you build up planets, and entire solar systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You add more and more ships to your fleet while using a skill tree to upgrade various things about your civilization. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Pickups</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides the normal skill tree upgrades, every galaxy unlocks special live-pickups that help you during an active run. Things like white-holes that produce more asteroids, to a time-space freezer which freezes all asteroids, to special comets that collect all asteroids at once. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Hazards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each galaxy unfortunately also introduces new hazards like time bombs that destroy all asteroids if not defused in time and rippers that invert the universe so it's all negative for that run. Make sure to avoid or disarm each hazard type.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple difficulty levels</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "An idler game where you get to build up the universe from scratch. You are a part of an advanced space civilization that builds universes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/e8e87913026726cc337a3e7f0c2e357acdec5d4a/header.jpg?t=1787928371", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/089b255327f3d373d25dc5fd2c6371aeab139b3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787928371", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606920/089b255327f3d373d25dc5fd2c6371aeab139b3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787928371", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minim